+**Production:**
+
+- expected queries = 1,233,792,000;
+- maximum queries = 1,403,136,000. The maximum is binding.
+- Necessary compute-only rates, excluding I/O: 48,720 queries/s (8 h) and 194,880 queries/s (2× rule, 4 h). Rate alone never establishes feasibility.
