+   - W = 3, x = 0 (reject), then a following accept;
+   - W = 3, x = 2^63;
+   - W = 2^39;
+   - a sequence of 16 rejections leading to exhaustion (DRAW_EXHAUSTED).
+2. CHECKPOINT hand trace covering:
+   - all four families;
