+11. CLASSIFIER:
+    - lo = δ exactly (not MATERIAL_POSITIVE);
+    - hi = −δ exactly;
+    - lo = −ε exactly;
+    - every pattern rule and every summary token S1–S5;
+    - a fallthrough interval of width greater than ε.
+12. COND_FORGE: an INJECTED CHECKPOINT at u=193, with an explicit r_t and an arbitrary state satisfying check-E invariants (cache_valid_mask = policy_mask), but not claimed to be reachable from any history. It is tested only under the conditional applicability rules in §16.4; it does not carry a cohort header, Philox-derived tape or history evidence.
+13. Three malformed inputs (key order, hex width, invalid nonzero cache). Their ERROR results are fixed by this protocol.
